  "note": "The evidence establishes separate comparisons for navel, firmness and chain. Their descent from a single root remains uncertain. The Aramaic adjective helps explain the idea of firmness, while the Hebrew passages establish the adverse sense of self-will. The pointer שֵׁרָשׁ has no independent occurrence here."
